			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1793531604056,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Every out-port has an adapter that implements it and delegates\nto the matching game in-port.\n\nFlow: out-port (red) -> adapter -> in-port (green).\n\nThe same move in-port serves every actor: human, AI, bot or\nnetwork client.",
			"fontSize": 30.86004075259779,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Every out-port has an adapter that implements it and delegates\nto the matching game in-port.\n\nFlow: out-port (red) -> adapter -> in-port (green).\n\nThe same move in-port serves every actor: human, AI, bot or\nnetwork client.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "Every out-port has an adapter that implements it and delegates\nto the matching game in-port.\n\nFlow: out-port (red) -> adapter -> in-port (green).\n\nThe same move in-port serves every actor: human, AI, bot or\nnetwork client.",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"link": null
		},
